To help you find a suitable hotel in London, I will use the `get_all_hotels_in_city` function to retrieve all hotels in the city. Then, I will apply a filter to select hotels with a rating of at least 4.0. From the results, I will choose the hotel with the highest rating and the most favorable price range. Once I have identified the hotel, I will use the `get_rating_reviews_for_hotels` function to gather reviews and ratings, ensuring a high-quality experience.

```json
{
  "function": "get_all_hotels_in_city",
  "arguments": {
    "city": "London"
  }
}
```

